menu "Dawning Eos Extensions"
    config DAWNING_CORE
        tristate "Dawning Core Functionality"
        default y
        help
          Enable Dawning Eos core features

    config DAWNING_DISPLAY
        bool "Dawning in-kernel compositor"
        depends on DAWNING_CORE && DRM && DRM_CLIENT
        default y
        help
          Own the display from kernel space: the compositor draws the
          desktop, windows and cursor itself through the in-kernel DRM
          client API rather than handing a device node to a userspace
          display server.
endmenu # Dawning Eos Extensions
